        "subheading": "",
        "title": "<p>Endless Ways to Personalise</p>",
        "description": "<p>At the heart of our expanded charm collection is the freedom to create a piece that feels distinctly your own. Each necklace can be thoughtfully curated to reflect your story, with personal details that carry meaning for years to come.</p>",
        "colour_style": "dark",
        "button_1_text": "",
